{"3518390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crimson Night", "steam_appid": 3518390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4312740], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518390/extras/966bd91960700ac8b6e708a412fc5124.poster.avif?t=1783701022\" width=800 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518390/extras/966bd91960700ac8b6e708a412fc5124.webm?t=1783701022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518390/extras/966bd91960700ac8b6e708a412fc5124.mp4?t=1783701022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crimson Night</strong> is an <strong>online</strong> co-op, turn-based medieval dark fantasy where survival is earned, not given.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players stand together each night against brutal waves of enemies, punishing bosses, and unpredictable events.<br>Explore diverse hubs during the day, prepare for what comes after sunset… and pray the moon stays merciful. <br>This world does not forgive mistakes, it teaches you through them.<br>You will <strong>fall</strong>.<br>You will <strong>die</strong>.<br>And you will rise stronger every time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features overview:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Online</strong> Turn-Based Co-Op Combat and World Exploration for 1–4 players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 6 Acts &amp; Hubs to <strong>explore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Hardcore Difficulty</strong> built around <strong>skill</strong>, <strong>teamwork</strong> &amp; <strong>mastery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>A lot</strong> of Enemy Types per act to keep combat <strong>fresh and brutal</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Unlockable Content:</strong> new classes, races, wave events &amp; more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Gear Progression and Looting across day exploration &amp; night combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Failure = Learning, only players themselves are responsible for their fate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  - 25 Hours of Gameplay <strong><i>NOT</i></strong> counting <strong>replayability</strong>.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518390/extras/86b95d357ed2bd324ebc56c2b7bf4d8b.poster.avif?t=1783701022\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518390/extras/86b95d357ed2bd324ebc56c2b7bf4d8b.webm?t=1783701022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518390/extras/86b95d357ed2bd324ebc56c2b7bf4d8b.mp4?t=1783701022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your party</strong>!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Shape your playstyle. Fail together. Learn together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>10 Playable Classes</strong> — <i>from brutal frontline fighters to twisted mages and tricksters</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>6 Selectable Races</strong> — <i>each with set starting stats</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow stronger every night...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>New Skills</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Stronger Weapons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Better Gear</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Shared Knowledge </strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518390/extras/7cb5d5393908a8ee2dd82e09458f3662.poster.avif?t=1783701022\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518390/extras/7cb5d5393908a8ee2dd82e09458f3662.webm?t=1783701022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518390/extras/7cb5d5393908a8ee2dd82e09458f3662.mp4?t=1783701022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skillchecks!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter challenges decision-making and execution.<br>There are different types of skillchecks to learn and overcome, rewarding teamwork, timing, and smart planning. <br>Failure isn’t punishment — it’s progress.<br>Every wipe brings understanding.<br>Every retry builds mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>If the moon claims you…</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>you’ll return sharper.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518390/extras/966bd91960700ac8b6e708a412fc5124.poster.avif?t=1783701022\" width=800 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518390/extras/966bd91960700ac8b6e708a412fc5124.webm?t=1783701022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518390/extras/966bd91960700ac8b6e708a412fc5124.mp4?t=1783701022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crimson Night</strong> is an <strong>online</strong> co-op, turn-based medieval dark fantasy where survival is earned, not given.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players stand together each night against brutal waves of enemies, punishing bosses, and unpredictable events.<br>Explore diverse hubs during the day, prepare for what comes after sunset… and pray the moon stays merciful. <br>This world does not forgive mistakes, it teaches you through them.<br>You will <strong>fall</strong>.<br>You will <strong>die</strong>.<br>And you will rise stronger every time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features overview:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Online</strong> Turn-Based Co-Op Combat and World Exploration for 1–4 players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 6 Acts &amp; Hubs to <strong>explore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Hardcore Difficulty</strong> built around <strong>skill</strong>, <strong>teamwork</strong> &amp; <strong>mastery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>A lot</strong> of Enemy Types per act to keep combat <strong>fresh and brutal</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Unlockable Content:</strong> new classes, races, wave events &amp; more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Gear Progression and Looting across day exploration &amp; night combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Failure = Learning, only players themselves are responsible for their fate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  - 25 Hours of Gameplay <strong><i>NOT</i></strong> counting <strong>replayability</strong>.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518390/extras/86b95d357ed2bd324ebc56c2b7bf4d8b.poster.avif?t=1783701022\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518390/extras/86b95d357ed2bd324ebc56c2b7bf4d8b.webm?t=1783701022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518390/extras/86b95d357ed2bd324ebc56c2b7bf4d8b.mp4?t=1783701022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your party</strong>!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Shape your playstyle. Fail together. Learn together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>10 Playable Classes</strong> — <i>from brutal frontline fighters to twisted mages and tricksters</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>6 Selectable Races</strong> — <i>each with set starting stats</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow stronger every night...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>New Skills</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Stronger Weapons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Better Gear</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Shared Knowledge </strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518390/extras/7cb5d5393908a8ee2dd82e09458f3662.poster.avif?t=1783701022\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518390/extras/7cb5d5393908a8ee2dd82e09458f3662.webm?t=1783701022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518390/extras/7cb5d5393908a8ee2dd82e09458f3662.mp4?t=1783701022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skillchecks!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter challenges decision-making and execution.<br>There are different types of skillchecks to learn and overcome, rewarding teamwork, timing, and smart planning. <br>Failure isn’t punishment — it’s progress.<br>Every wipe brings understanding.<br>Every retry builds mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>If the moon claims you…</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>you’ll return sharper.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Crimson